@startuml SC_IncidentTicket
title IncidentTicket lifecycle (UC-I02, FR-NI-02)
[*] --> Reported : Valid Student report or fault telemetry
Reported : Vehicle restricted from new allocation
Reported --> Investigating : Operator opens and accepts ticket
Reported --> Reported : Duplicate fault evidence / append once
Investigating --> ActionAssigned : Record corrective action or repair plan
ActionAssigned --> InRepair : Repair work begins
InRepair --> InRepair : Progress update; repair incomplete
InRepair --> Resolved : Repair complete AND safe restoration verified
ActionAssigned --> Resolved : Recovery complete AND safe restoration verified
Resolved --> Closed : Operator closes ticket
Resolved --> Investigating : Fault recurs before closure
Closed --> [*]
note right of Resolved
Vehicle eligibility is restored only after
completed repair/recovery is recorded and
no conflicting commitment or fault remains.
end note
@enduml
